{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1770437629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1770437629 width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenarian\u00a0</strong>is a single-player action RPG where monsters aren\u2019t just enemies \u2014 they\u2019re opportunities. Hunt powerful creatures, collect weapons and skillstones to steal their abilities, and shape your own fighting style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spit poison like a spider, slash through relentless foes, and grow stronger as you face deadlier challenges. Sharpen your weapons, choose how you fight, and live the life of a Mercenary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt and Slash Your Enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Mercenary, combat is your way of survival. Hunt dangerous monsters and slash them all. Every battle pushes you toward deadlier challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/eb3bcd1e2f70414587213e3dbf64b50d.poster.avif?t=1770437629\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/eb3bcd1e2f70414587213e3dbf64b50d.webm?t=1770437629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Stronger Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger monsters demand better preparation. Find powerful weapons from markets or monster drops, and choose from over <strong>30 weapons across three types</strong> \u2014 <strong>One-Handed, Two-Handed, and Spear</strong>, each offering its own strengths and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1770437629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1770437629 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your weapons, improve your character\u2019s stats, upgrade item capacity limits, and gain experience as you rise from a newbie into a <strong>Professional Mercenary</strong>, mastering the art of monster slaying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.poster.avif?t=1770437629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.webm?t=1770437629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.mp4?t=1770437629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal Your Enemy Abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters are born with dangerous abilities \u2014 poison spitting, teleportation, diving underground, dashes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using <strong>Skillstones</strong>, you can steal these powers for yourself. Equip up to <strong>five out of 40+ Skillstones</strong> to redefine how you approach combat and adapt to any enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4b28642b5c49ac8941863c18aa031b59.avif?t=1770437629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/4b28642b5c49ac8941863c18aa031b59.avif?t=1770437629 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise Pet Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find young monsters, capture them, and raise them with care. Feed them properly and watch them grow \u2014 but remember, even monsters require attention to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4fc3fa755748806ef930009d83df2b73.poster.avif?t=1770437629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4fc3fa755748806ef930009d83df2b73.webm?t=1770437629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of monsters with unique abilities</strong> to fight, steal, and master.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ weapons </strong>across three types \u2014 <strong>One-Handed, Two-Handed, and Spear</strong>, each offering a distinct combat style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ Skillstones</strong> that grant powerful abilities such as poison spitting, summoning, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful progression and upgrades</strong>! Weapons, potions, item carrying capacity, and character stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise monsters and watch them grow\u00a0</strong>\u2014\u00a0Find young monsters and raise them.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2952740?t=1770437629","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770437629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/be56cffbfd0abfbd768da41f2ba008aacb492996/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770437629","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/be56cffbfd0abfbd768da41f2ba008aacb492996/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770437629","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4334000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Discord &amp; Chat With Dev!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/f977c68810557ce36ed8bb69652d8a95.avif?t=1770437629\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1770437629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1770437629 width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenarian\u00a0</strong>is a single-player action RPG where monsters aren\u2019t just enemies \u2014 they\u2019re opportunities. Hunt powerful creatures, collect weapons and skillstones to steal their abilities, and shape your own fighting style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spit poison like a spider, slash through relentless foes, and grow stronger as you face deadlier challenges. Sharpen your weapons, choose how you fight, and live the life of a Mercenary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt and Slash Your Enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Mercenary, combat is your way of survival. Hunt dangerous monsters and slash them all. Every battle pushes you toward deadlier challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/eb3bcd1e2f70414587213e3dbf64b50d.poster.avif?t=1770437629\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/eb3bcd1e2f70414587213e3dbf64b50d.webm?t=1770437629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Stronger Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stronger monsters demand better preparation. Find powerful weapons from markets or monster drops, and choose from over <strong>30 weapons across three types</strong> \u2014 <strong>One-Handed, Two-Handed, and Spear</strong>, each offering its own strengths and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1770437629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1770437629 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your weapons, improve your character\u2019s stats, upgrade item capacity limits, and gain experience as you rise from a newbie into a <strong>Professional Mercenary</strong>, mastering the art of monster slaying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.poster.avif?t=1770437629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.webm?t=1770437629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/6430c0c6cd8eed2c2c29908265472989.mp4?t=1770437629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steal Your Enemy Abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters are born with dangerous abilities \u2014 poison spitting, teleportation, diving underground, dashes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using <strong>Skillstones</strong>, you can steal these powers for yourself. Equip up to <strong>five out of 40+ Skillstones</strong> to redefine how you approach combat and adapt to any enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4b28642b5c49ac8941863c18aa031b59.avif?t=1770437629\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras_big/4b28642b5c49ac8941863c18aa031b59.avif?t=1770437629 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise Pet Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find young monsters, capture them, and raise them with care. Feed them properly and watch them grow \u2014 but remember, even monsters require attention to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4fc3fa755748806ef930009d83df2b73.poster.avif?t=1770437629\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4fc3fa755748806ef930009d83df2b73.webm?t=1770437629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of monsters with unique abilities</strong> to fight, steal, and master.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ weapons </strong>across three types \u2014 <strong>One-Handed, Two-Handed, and Spear</strong>, each offering a distinct combat style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ Skillstones</strong> that grant powerful abilities such as poison spitting, summoning, and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful progression and upgrades</strong>! Weapons, potions, item carrying capacity, and character stats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise monsters and watch them grow\u00a0</strong>\u2014\u00a0Find young monsters and raise them.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Good Spuun"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access"